.TH THUGSRF 1 "September 2026" "THUGS(red) RF 0.2.0"
.SH NAME
thugsrf \- modular radio signal intelligence workbench
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thugsrf
[--device hackrf|rtl|audio|demo] [--frequency HZ] [--sample-rate HZ] [COMMAND]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Native Linux Rust CLI and full-color terminal UI for HackRF, RTL-SDR and ALSA.
Run without a command to open the TUI. Space starts passive reception.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Inspect SDR and audio devices.
.TP
.B record OUTPUT --seconds N
Capture finite IQ or audio. Existing files are never overwritten.
.TP
.B analyze INPUT --format cs8|cu8|wav --png OUTPUT
Compute FFT spectra and signal candidates, save to SQLite and optionally export PNG.
.TP
.B scan --start HZ --end HZ --step HZ
Capture a finite range of center frequencies.
.TP
.B decode INPUT --mode ook|fsk
Extract raw OOK envelope timings or instantaneous frequency.
.TP
.B addon install|list|enable|disable|toggle|run|run-enabled
Manage language-neutral executable JSON addons.
.TP
.B encode OUTPUT --bits 1010 --mode ook|afsk
Generate an IQ or WAV file without transmitting it.
.TP
.B demod INPUT OUTPUT --mode am|fm
Demodulate centered IQ into WAV.
.TP
.B replay INPUT --confirm-tx
Transmit a finite cs8 recording with HackRF.
.TP
.B play INPUT
Play WAV using ALSA.
.TP
.B ai --input INPUT | --image IMAGE
Explicitly submit measured features or images to the configured AI endpoint.
.TP
.B config set KEY VALUE
Validate and persist a user setting. Use the TUI to edit interactively.
.TP
.B history [--export ID]
List investigations or export a stored JSON report.
.TP
.B export-pcap INPUT OUTPUT --protocol ble|ax25|gsm
Decode recovered protocol frames to PCAP and a provenance sidecar.
.TP
.B identify INPUT
Run enabled compatible identifiers concurrently and save their evidence.
.TP
.B listen --frequency HZ --mode am|fm|wfm --bandwidth HZ
Listen through ALSA. TUI tab 8 provides SW/MW and FM presets.
.TP
.B talk --frequency HZ --seconds N --confirm-tx
Finite HackRF microphone AM/FM transmission; at most 60 seconds.
.TP
.B channels [add|set|remove]
Manage the local channel and repeater directory. TUI tab 9 lists entries.
.TP
.B sigid sync|status|lookup
Sync factual SigID Wiki metadata and rank reference candidates offline.
.TP
.B frequency sources|import|lookup
Import sourced HTML/CSV frequency references and look up channel hints.
.PP
TUI tab 7 provides a sequential 1 MHz to 6 GHz HackRF sweep panorama.
.SH FILES
~/.config/thugsrf/config.toml
.br
~/.config/thugsrf/decoders/*/addon.toml
.br
~/.config/thugsrf/identifiers/*/addon.toml
.br
~/.local/share/thugsrf/investigations.sqlite3
.PP
XDG_CONFIG_HOME and XDG_DATA_HOME override the default roots.
